COMMUNITY PREAMBLE
---------------------------------------------
Astral Void was crafted with passion, precision, and deep appreciation for the
Linux desktop community, Arch Linux, CachyOS, Hyprland, and the HyDE Project.

We believe that a workspace is more than just configuration files—it is the
canvas where engineers, creators, students, and dreamers build the future.
Every color gradient, glassmorphic capsule, and script in this repository was
designed to give you an inspiring, legible, and rock-solid environment.

You are completely free to:
  • Use Astral Void on as many personal or professional machines as you wish.
  • Study how the scripts, GTK/Qt rules, and compositor shaders work.
  • Remix, adapt, and fork this theme to create your own cosmic variations.
  • Share your setups and screenshots with the community.

All we kindly ask in return is that you keep the original copyright notice intact
when redistributing substantial portions of this work, respecting the effort
invested in bringing this project to life.

Explore the void. Make it yours.

